  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 812, top: 126, width: 412, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.4, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 8 }}>01 / SEPARATION</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7', marginBottom: 6 }}>理解与计算分离</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
        模型擅长的语义判断交给模型；模型容易出错的算术与时间交给代码。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.4, color: '#34D399', marginBottom: 8 }}>02 / TWO LAYERS</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7', marginBottom: 6 }}>压缩 + 保真并存</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
        事实层有损但可计算；证据层无损但只做保底。两层同时进入上下文。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.4, color: '#FBBF24', marginBottom: 8 }}>03 / AUDIT</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7', marginBottom: 6 }}>每条事实可溯源</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
        每个 Event 持有证据指针（会话 id + 轮次号），任何结论都能回查到原句。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

